Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.90,0:01:35.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}各位大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My lords
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.48,0:01:38.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后擅自离席\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the absence of the queen herself,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.06,0:01:41.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}本庭宣判其违反法庭命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}whom this tribunal has pronounced contumacious,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.60,0:01:43.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}既然王后传唤时缺席\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}since she does not appear when summoned,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.35,0:01:47.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}本庭将试图裁决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we are trying to determine whether or not
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.06,0:01:50.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其与亚瑟王子的第一次婚姻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}her first marriage to prince arthur was
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.39,0:01:53.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是否有过真正的肉体关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in fact consummated incarnal copula.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.60,0:01:55.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}传证人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We call a witness:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.94,0:01:58.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安东尼-威勒比先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir anthony willoughby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.10,0:02:10.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我清楚你一直护送\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I understand you were in the escort
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.79,0:02:13.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亚瑟王子步入婚床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}taking prince arthur to the nuptial bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.43,0:02:14.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.44,0:02:17.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的父亲当时是国王家仆的主事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My father was at the time steward of the king's household.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.51,0:02:20.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以我在场见证了王子…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So I was present when the prince was...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.35,0:02:23.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}进入了凯瑟琳女士的… 床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}inserted into lady katherine's bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.76,0:02:26.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早上醒来的时候也是如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And also when he woke in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.86,0:02:29.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你早上见到王子的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And did the prince say anything to you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.93,0:02:31.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他可曾对你说过什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when you saw him in the morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.68,0:02:33.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 大人 他说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, sir. He said:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.10,0:02:36.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"威勒比 我很渴 给我一杯麦芽酒"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Willoughby, I'm thirsty. Bring me a cup of ale.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.43,0:02:40.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"昨晚我深入了西班牙腹地"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Last night I was in the midst of spain. "
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.98,0:02:44.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}肃静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.69,0:02:46.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}禁止喧哗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Silence in the court!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.98,0:02:53.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有别的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.31,0:02:55.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 先生 那天晚些时候他又对我们说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, sir. Later that day he said to us:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.94,0:03:00.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"诸位 找个老婆是一项好消遣"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"Masters, it's a good pastime to have a wife. "
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.19,0:03:04.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法庭禁止喧哗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Silence in the court!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.23,0:03:09.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信我们有那条沾血的床单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I believe we may have the bloodstained sheets
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.06,0:03:11.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以确证先王的真实事迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to corroborate my lord's story.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.10,0:03:15.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是最有力的证据 主教大人 最能说明问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That would be most useful,your eminence. Most useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.73,0:03:53.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.99,0:03:55.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.19,0:03:58.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王质问您为何离庭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}King asks why You are not in court.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.18,0:04:01.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经表明我的答案与立场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have given answer to that already.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.10,0:04:05.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能否进一步说话？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Could we go somewhere private?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.08,0:04:06.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么？我没什么见不得人的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why? I have nothing to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.98,0:04:10.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我的女仆们还有整个世界 听您大放厥词吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let my ladies and the whole world hear what you have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.98,0:04:14.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王命令您在这件事上…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The King commands that you surrender...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.85,0:04:17.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}完全臣服于他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}this whole matter into his hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.14,0:04:19.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}否则法庭会判您有罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Otherwise the court will condemn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.23,0:04:22.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听到这个请求我真是惊讶万分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am surprised to receive such a request
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.89,0:04:25.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尤其是您这样一位贤明高贵的大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}from such a wise and noble man as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.18,0:04:27.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只是一个可怜的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am but a poor woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.77,0:04:30.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}失去了智慧 失去了理解力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}lacking both in wit and understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.17,0:04:32.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我该如何回应…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How am I supposed to respond to such
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.90,0:04:34.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个突然提出的请求？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a request made to me out of the blue?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.17,0:04:35.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您完全明白国王的意愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know perfectly well what the king desires
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.93,0:04:37.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您也清楚他有什么想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and what he shall have.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.35,0:04:41.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只知道 主教大人 是你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All I know, eminence,is that you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.14,0:04:43.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出于私欲 煽风点火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for your own purposes,have kindled this fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.61,0:04:46.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每时每刻 每年每月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All this time,all these years,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.69,0:04:50.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也曾怀疑过 你清高的傲慢和虚伪的荣耀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have wondered at your high pride and your vain glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.07,0:04:53.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我憎恶你骄奢淫逸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have abhorred your voluptuous life and had no regard
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.03,0:04:56.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我蔑视你恃强凌弱 专横独行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}at all for your presumptuous power and your tyranny!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.29,0:04:59.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也知道你怨恨我侄子罗马皇帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know also your malice against my nephew the emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.76,0:05:03.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恨之入骨 如同蛇蝎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You hate him like a scorpion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.39,0:05:04.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.45,0:05:07.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为他未曾满足你的野心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because he would not satisfy your ambition
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.54,0:05:08.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}未曾强行让你登上教皇宝座\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and make you pope by force.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.77,0:05:10.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人 你绝对不能凭空认定…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Madam, You should never presume to know-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.73,0:05:13.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我唯一的快感就是挫败你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My only satisfaction is that in frustrating you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.56,0:05:16.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把你从国王的宠爱中快点拉下马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hasten your fall from the king's good graces
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.55,0:05:20.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只要这个结果 为此不惜一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}an outcome I desire above all others.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.90,0:05:29.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}主教大人请停步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hold, Your eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.52,0:05:31.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}走这条路无法达成离婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will not get your divorce this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.52,0:05:35.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我们已经无路可走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.02,0:05:47.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}朋友 我要喝酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Friend! Give me a drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.22,0:05:48.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}渴死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm thirsty!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.69,0:05:52.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们要是像我昨天晚上那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you'd all been to spain as many times
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.66,0:05:53.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一连几次跨进西班牙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as I went there last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.42,0:05:56.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们也会渴得要死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you'd all be fucking thirsty too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.15,0:06:02.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}插 抽 插 抽 插 抽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In, out,in, out, in out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.60,0:06:05.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我告诉你啊 小伙子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I'll tell you this, lads:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.51,0:06:09.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我第一次和女人睡觉的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}First time I lay with a lady
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.62,0:06:11.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}完全是黄毛小子 什么都不懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was but a chit of a lad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.85,0:06:14.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的小老二翘得有这么高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So high to a grasshopper I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.48,0:06:16.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我干了她一整晚…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I poked her all night...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.90,0:06:21.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}干杯 我说 敬一杯酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A toast!I say, a toast
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.17,0:06:23.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为凯瑟琳皇后干杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to queen katherine!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.64,0:06:26.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她不屈不饶 上帝保佑她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who doesn't give a fig!God bless her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.22,0:06:28.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为英格兰皇后干杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To the queen of england!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.37,0:06:36.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王陛下到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His majesty, the king!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.85,0:06:53.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}各位大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My lords.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.90,0:06:54.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.29,0:07:04.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真华丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Splendid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.12,0:07:15.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的眼线刚刚告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So my sources have just told me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.09,0:07:18.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗马皇帝坚信沃尔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that the emperor believes wolsey
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.73,0:07:20.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是鼓动离婚的罪魁祸首\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is to blame for instigating the divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.03,0:07:23.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他相信英格兰人民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He believes that the people of england
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.77,0:07:26.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会马上起义 把那个禽兽送上绞架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}will soon rise up and bring that creature to the scaffold.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.64,0:07:28.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他死期不远矣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His end is surely approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.27,0:07:31.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那之后 大人您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}After which, your grace
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.06,0:07:32.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将会成为宫廷的首要人物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}will be the first man at court
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.65,0:07:35.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}实至名归\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as you ought to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.04,0:07:36.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样的话 博林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In which case, boleyn,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.69,0:07:40.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我绝对会扩大你的家族利益\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shan't fail to promote your family's interests.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.14,0:07:42.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}千真万确 你已经位高权重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's true you've risen high.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.53,0:07:44.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过还可以再高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But you shall rise higher yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.48,0:07:51.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你发现了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}did You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.02,0:07:54.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们都在看你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They were all looking at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.49,0:07:58.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很高兴 我要他们都看你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm glad. I want them to look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.18,0:08:01.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要他们嫉妒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want them to be envious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.25,0:08:05.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要所有人都知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want all of them to know
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.87,0:08:08.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有多么爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}exactly how much I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.01,0:08:14.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后就像我的家族格言所说 我拥有"无上的荣福"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then, like My family motto I am "the most happy. "
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.47,0:08:21.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今天法庭进展如何？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How did it go in court today?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.58,0:08:24.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.15,0:08:26.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳仍然拒绝出席\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet katherine refuses to attend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.44,0:08:28.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这无关紧要了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It will make no difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.44,0:08:31.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}沃尔西许诺我夏天就可离婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wolsey promises me I'll have a divorce by summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.10,0:08:34.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}许诺容易 兑现困难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Promises are easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.10,0:08:39.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你不能离婚呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What if you don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.02,0:08:54.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛格丽特 怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Margaret, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.51,0:08:59.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我睡不着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I couldn't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.92,0:09:02.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}回到床上来 天很冷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come back to bed. It's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.54,0:09:04.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等一阵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.72,0:09:11.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明天我要出庭 你去吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm going to court tomorrow. Will you come?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.43,0:09:13.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的兄长又一次要求你出席\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your brother has asked,again, for your presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.82,0:09:16.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我说得很清楚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.19,0:09:20.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不要看到他如此公开的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not while he makes love in
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.63,0:09:22.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和那个叫博林的女人 眉来眼去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}public to that boleyn girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.12,0:09:27.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这件事情如此令人生厌 把他变成了一个傻瓜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's offensive and it makes him look like a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.15,0:09:32.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明眼人都能看出…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everyone else can see how...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.86,0:09:35.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}博林一家多么狂妄和贪婪 他怎么就看不出来？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}proud and grasping the boleyns are. Why can't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.74,0:09:38.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}假如他命令你出席呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what if He commands you to come?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.35,0:09:59.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是干吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.72,0:10:05.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个妻子看着她的丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}only a wife to a husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.60,0:10:15.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}睡吧 我亲爱的查尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sleep now, my sweet charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.48,0:10:20.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我为你祈祷 安睡吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I pray you,sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.36,0:11:18.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法庭肃静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Silence in the court!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.82,0:11:23.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在王后缺席的情况下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the absence of the queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.48,0:11:28.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她的顾问菲舍主教请求我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we have been asked by her council, bishop fisher,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.75,0:11:31.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在本庭发表声明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to make a statement to this court.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.66,0:11:35.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}既然如此 我们决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In the circumstances we have decided
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.04,0:11:38.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}准许发言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that such a statement is admissible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.60,0:11:41.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.48,0:11:53.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法官大人 诸位身负\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our honours,you have been asked to give verdict...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.60,0:11:55.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为这段王室婚姻的合法性做出裁决 的重任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}on the validity of the royal marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.07,0:12:02.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阁下们 在下的观点是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sirs, it is my contention that this marriage
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.35,0:12:06.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王与王后的婚姻不能 被任何强势所拆散\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of the king and queen can be dissolved by no power,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.65,0:12:09.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无论强加拆散的是凡人 还是神力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}human or divine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.05,0:12:13.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我们… 让我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let'S... let me give,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.12,0:12:15.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果可以的话… 为大家复述一段平行经文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if I might, a biblical parallel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.88,0:12:18.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我坚信你们会记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will remember, I am sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.09,0:12:20.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}暴君希律王…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the tyrant herod antipas...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.97,0:12:21.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}暴君 暴君\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tyrant, tyrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.96,0:12:24.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}抛弃自己的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}... Who disembarrassed himself of his wife
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.37,0:12:27.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为了占有他的弟媳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in order that he might take his brother's wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.54,0:12:33.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后当施洗约翰(耶稣的表兄) 敢于指责这对王室夫妻的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And who then executed john the baptist
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.06,0:12:37.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}希律王就处死了施洗约翰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when he dared to criticize the royal couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.32,0:12:41.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正如如施洗约翰一般\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just as john the baptist, so I,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.79,0:12:44.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我怀拥人类的谦卑 向高高在上的你们宣布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in all humility,say to you here today
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.30,0:12:48.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经准备好用我的生命为代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that I am ready to lay down my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.98,0:12:52.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}用我的生命为代价 去捍卫婚姻的神圣不可侵犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to lay down my life,to defend the sanctity
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.25,0:12:56.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去声讨可耻的通奸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of marriage and to condemn adultery!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.29,0:12:58.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}蛮不讲理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Outrageous!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.13,0:13:00.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法官大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your honours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.92,0:13:04.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我控诉这个人 菲舍主教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I accuse this man,bishop fisher,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.77,0:13:09.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}控诉他的傲慢 鲁莽与背信弃义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of arrogance, temerity and disloyalty!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.33,0:13:14.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我强烈要求 不要理会这一派胡言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I demand that you disregard every vile word.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.85,0:13:26.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯 你来了 来一杯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah, thomas. Come in. Drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.81,0:13:28.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不用了 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not for me,thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.85,0:13:29.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.55,0:13:35.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有个任务要托付余你 托马斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have a mission for you, thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.70,0:13:40.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法国和罗马帝国军队已经停火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The french and imperial forces have ceased their aggression.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.71,0:13:43.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将会有会议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is to be some sort of conference
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.24,0:13:45.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在法国的康比亚召开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}at a place called cambria, in france,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.14,0:13:47.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有双方谈判代表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}between their negotiators and
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.54,0:13:50.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以及罗马教皇的代表人参加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}also with representatives of the pope.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.11,0:13:54.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我肯定无法参加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I of course, am unable to attend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.84,0:13:57.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯 关键是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The vital thing, thomas,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.26,0:14:02.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法国和罗马帝国两方不能达成一致\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is that there be no agreement between the other 2 parties.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.27,0:14:06.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经私下得到法国国王的保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've had private reassurances from the king of france
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.47,0:14:09.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他毕竟是我们的盟友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who is after all, our ally that he will never make
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.94,0:14:12.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无论如何他也不会和罗马皇帝达成和解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}peace with the emperor,under any circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.78,0:14:16.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}同样 教皇和罗马皇帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Similarly, there must be no rapprochement
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.83,0:14:19.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也没可能和解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}between the holy father and the emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.23,0:14:22.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你要明白 在这种情况下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must understand,under those circumstances,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.62,0:14:26.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让教皇满足国王陛下的愿望 是没有可能的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it would be impossible for the pope to grant the king his desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.22,0:14:29.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 我的确明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, I do understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.48,0:14:30.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.78,0:14:34.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你有你的原则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you have your principles,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.88,0:14:36.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.80,0:14:39.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但出于我们二人对国王的爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But for the love we both have for the king,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.91,0:14:43.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但你得在康比亚尽可能 加以阻止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}your job at cambria is to be as obstructive as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.16,0:14:46.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}千万别让弗朗西斯违背 对我们许下的承诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't let francis renege on his commitments to us
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.90,0:14:48.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也别让教皇忘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and don't let the pope forget
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.84,0:14:52.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是查尔斯的军队 入侵并洗劫了罗马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that it was charles' forces that invaded and sacked rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.01,0:14:56.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 还有件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh. And there is one other thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.62,0:14:58.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除此之外？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}More than this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.27,0:15:01.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}暗地里透过那边的密探打探\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Try to discover, by subtle means, through
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.37,0:15:04.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看看罗马皇帝是否准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}his agents,if the emperor is prepared to
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.36,0:15:06.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}通过武力支持他的姑姑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}support his aunt by use of force.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.02,0:15:09.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你认为他会为了支持皇后而入侵英格兰？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You think He might invade england in support of the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.17,0:15:12.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没有"认为"任何事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't think anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.16,0:15:14.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而是考虑到各个方面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I imagine everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.89,0:15:19.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正是那些顾虑让我痛苦 Thomas\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And it is those imaginings that cause me great pain, thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.99,0:15:21.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}相当痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Great pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.87,0:15:24.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不是说过吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But wasn't it you that said
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.56,0:15:27.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有人可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}no man can expect to go to
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.25,0:15:29.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}轻易就上天堂？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}heaven on a feather bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.23,0:15:49.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你就没点好话说吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ave you nokind things to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.85,0:15:52.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好话？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kind?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.48,0:15:54.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对你的妻子说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to Your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.10,0:15:56.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对你孩子的母亲说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The mother of your child!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.94,0:15:59.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在公众面前对我百般羞辱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You treat me so unkindly and in public negle
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.23,0:16:02.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳 你必须面对现实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}katherine, You must accept the inevitable!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.17,0:16:05.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大部分高层舆论都反对我们在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The weight of academic opinion is against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.45,0:16:08.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们本就不是合法夫妻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We were never legally man and wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.34,0:16:11.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}教庭会按照我的意志裁决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the court will decide in my favour.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.39,0:16:13.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果他们不遵从我的意愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And if the court does not decide in my favour,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.75,0:16:18.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我将如异教徒般违抗教皇 并同我心爱的女人结婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall denounce the pope as a heretic and marry whom I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.67,0:16:26.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲爱的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sweetheart...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.65,0:16:33.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当我初次与您共寝的时候 是个有天使陪伴的处女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}by all the angels I was intact when I came to your bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.59,0:16:35.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}行了 你就他妈的是个处女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alright!So You were a fucking virgin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.25,0:16:38.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那不是关键\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's not the point!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.23,0:16:51.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不是告诉过你 如果你和皇后争吵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did I Not tell You that if You argued with the queen
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.56,0:16:53.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她肯定会占上风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she'd be sure to have the upper hand?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.14,0:16:54.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 但… 总有一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, but...one fine morning
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.60,0:16:56.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会被她的那番道理说服 遗弃我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you'll succumb to her reasoning and cast me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.89,0:16:59.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你到底想说什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what do You mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.59,0:17:02.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安 我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anne, I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.23,0:17:03.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}放开我 放开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let me go! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.35,0:17:06.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你为什么不明白？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.81,0:17:08.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么就是不懂？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why can't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.56,0:17:11.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经等了那么久 为了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've been waiting for so long. For what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.38,0:17:14.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我原本可能已经有了一桩好婚事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In the meantime I could have contracted
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.14,0:17:16.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}生儿育女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}some advantageous marriage,and borne sons,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.64,0:17:19.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是女人一生向往的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which is a woman's greatest consolation in this life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.61,0:17:21.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但现在浪费我的时间 我的青春\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But instead I've been wasting my time and my youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.01,0:17:23.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毫无意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For no purpose at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.74,0:17:25.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安 别这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anne, stop this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.60,0:17:27.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会有儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will have sons!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.43,0:17:29.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们会有儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We will have sons!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.67,0:17:31.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不 太迟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No!No. It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.85,0:17:34.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你妻子不会放过你 我早该明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your wife won't let you go. I should have realized.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.55,0:17:35.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你去哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where areou going?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.72,0:17:36.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.35,0:17:38.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}留下来 我求你了 安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stay here, I beg you. Anne!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.10,0:17:41.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是英格兰的国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm the king of england!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.23,0:17:44.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}速速让路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Make way for his grace!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.17,0:17:45.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让让\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Make way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.89,0:17:57.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}主教大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.52,0:17:59.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Grazie, Grazie, grazie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.56,0:18:04.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}教皇送来的急件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An urgent message from the pope.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.18,0:18:06.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢你 年轻人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank You, kind sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.93,0:18:20.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瞧 他总得依靠别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look! He's always leaning on someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.64,0:18:23.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许有人得依靠他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps Someone should lean on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.77,0:18:26.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.56,0:18:29.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}主教大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.01,0:18:31.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.18,0:18:34.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信马上就会公布裁决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I trust we will soon have a verdict.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.01,0:18:36.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}的确如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.43,0:18:47.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听到德国发生的事 我们很悲痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we hear with great distress of events in germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.26,0:18:49.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}教堂被破坏的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The destruction of the churches.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.59,0:18:51.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是个悲惨事件 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Melancholy events, majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.96,0:18:54.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但为什么会发生这样的事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but why is it happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.01,0:18:56.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下的意思是？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.77,0:18:58.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我来告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.78,0:19:01.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}路德教看中罗马的弱点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The lutherans attack what they
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.45,0:19:03.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就会对其进行攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}see as the wickedness of rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.84,0:19:06.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们相信腐败受人推崇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They believe corruption is rewarded,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.65,0:19:11.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而信仰已经被遗弃 被置之不理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but the faithful are abandoned and badly treated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.10,0:19:18.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是个虔诚的人 主教大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am a man of faith,your eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.73,0:19:25.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝不会任由教皇 违背我的意愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}God forbid his holiness should ever turn his back on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.93,0:20:16.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.81,0:20:20.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不感到厌烦吗 查尔斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't you ever gettired of it, charles?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.62,0:20:21.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.52,0:20:22.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}厌倦了就到头大睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then I go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.26,0:20:25.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我敢打赌你一定也梦到女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I bet youdream of women too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.72,0:20:26.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.19,0:20:28.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我梦见上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I dream of god.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.48,0:20:30.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}梦见天堂与地狱 在梦中忏悔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of heavenand hell and of repentance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.89,0:20:33.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}既然你这么问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Since you asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.64,0:20:43.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想什么呢 安东尼？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are youthinking, anthony?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.18,0:20:49.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听着歌曲 想着那句 "Omnia vincit amor"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm listening tothe song and I'm thinking: Omnia vincit amor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.89,0:20:57.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"Omnia vincit amor" 没人能抵挡爱情的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Omnia vincit amor, "no one can resist love".
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.06,0:21:11.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.68,0:21:13.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.56,0:21:17.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请让安回到宫里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please ask anne to come back to court.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.01,0:21:20.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我衷心的请求您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I beg you for my sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.05,0:21:23.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不能没有她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can't live without her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.56,0:21:27.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明天裁决将会宣布 我也将自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tomorrow I shall have my verdict and I shall be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.73,0:21:32.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.39,0:21:59.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}各位主教大人 根据此高等法庭的规则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Eminences,in accordance with the rules and
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.56,0:22:03.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}及陛下的个人意愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}laws of this tribunal and the wishes of his majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.43,0:22:06.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请您正式宣布裁决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I ask you officially to deliver your judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.06,0:22:15.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下… 各位大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty... my lords.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.43,0:22:19.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}经过慎重考虑 我们决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}After much deliberation,we have decided that
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.27,0:22:22.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这一事件过于重大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}this great matter is too important to be here decided
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.86,0:22:26.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}需要经由罗马元老院审视后进行裁决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}without consultation with the curia at rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.21,0:22:32.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不巧的是 元老院正值夏季休会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Unfortunately, the curia is now in summer recess.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.18,0:22:36.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因此 别无他法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In which case there is no alternative
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.49,0:22:41.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只能将此案推延至10月1日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but to prorogue thistribunal until october 1st.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.84,0:22:44.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这就是我们的裁决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is our judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.98,0:23:38.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}蠢货\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You stupid cunt!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.52,0:23:48.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝为证 自从你担任英格兰的红衣主教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By god, it has never been good to be in england while
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.22,0:23:49.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}英格兰就没一天好日子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we've have cardinals among us!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.68,0:23:52.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你真的人为这一切都是我的罪过？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you so dense that you really think this is my doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.93,0:23:54.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所有人中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And of all people,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.77,0:23:57.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是最不该对红衣主教如此无理的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you have the least cause to be offended by cardinals!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.01,0:24:02.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果不是我这个小小的红衣主教 时不时为你说好话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If it wasn't for me,a simple cardinal,sometimes having praised you,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.51,0:24:05.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你早就人头不保了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you would no longer have a head on your shoulders!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.89,0:24:13.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多好的一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Happy day
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.43,0:24:15.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 蒙多萨大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}aaa
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.81,0:24:22.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}坎佩吉奥从教皇那里收到秘密指示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}aaaa
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.84,0:24:25.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他提议将离婚案交由罗马元老院处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}aaaaa
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.44,0:24:28.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没有被抛弃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}aaaaaa
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.16,0:24:30.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗马皇帝一直在为您的事 不知疲倦的奔走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}aaaaaaa
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.23,0:24:37.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你真的要走了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is it true you are leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.59,0:24:40.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 皇后陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.64,0:24:43.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}查普大使将替代我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ambassador chapuys will replace me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.23,0:24:47.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.27,0:24:49.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是最值得信赖的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's a mosttrustworthy person
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.31,0:24:53.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会尽心尽力维护您的权益\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and will take up your defense with all fidelity and diligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.88,0:24:57.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正如您一样 蒙多萨大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As you have done,senor mendoza.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.06,0:25:05.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个送给您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Toman esto.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.21,0:25:07.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}留个纪念\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In memory of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.52,0:25:21.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}majestad.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.36,0:25:38.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯 看到你真高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thomas, how verygood to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.89,0:25:41.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How is the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.14,0:25:46.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王将要巡游\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The king is ah... going on a progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.30,0:25:47.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}立即出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.43,0:25:51.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和安女士同行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With the lady anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.23,0:25:52.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.48,0:25:56.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请告诉陛下 我将立即把达拉谟教区的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell his majesty that I am handing over to him
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.57,0:25:59.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所有税收上交给他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}at once the entire revenues of the see of durham.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.31,0:26:01.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是英格兰最富有的地区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is one of the richest in england.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.85,0:26:06.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉他 我将继续为他的事而努力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And tell him I shall not cease to work for his great matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.57,0:26:10.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}坎佩吉奥和我会努力达成他的心愿 明白？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Campeggio and I will gladly accomplish his lawful desire. Do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.83,0:26:14.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会告诉他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.43,0:26:16.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.81,0:26:25.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我 我能指望你 为我在国王面前说些好话吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}tell me I can trust you to advocate my interests to the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.99,0:26:32.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}放心 没有你 我还只是个文员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You ma for without you, I would be a lowly clerk,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.17,0:26:35.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毫无收益 毫无前途\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}without profit or future.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.60,0:26:38.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的一生都是欠你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I owe you my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.69,0:27:04.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗马教廷召我去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've been summoned to rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.44,0:27:07.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我得去见教皇 亲自解决我的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have to appear before the pope and answer for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.27,0:27:08.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能想象吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can you imagine it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.72,0:27:13.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我？英格兰国王 除了上帝之外 不会听从任何势力的摆布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Me?The king of england, who answers to no authority but god!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.08,0:27:15.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}该死的沃尔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Damn wolsey.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.68,0:27:17.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诅咒他下地狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Damn him to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.42,0:27:19.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可否直言两句？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I speak plainly?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.36,0:27:20.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.18,0:27:25.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有些势力认为不该听从教皇的安排\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are some who on good authority care not for popes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.07,0:27:30.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些作家写道 国王在自己的王国里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These writers say that the king is both emperor
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.25,0:27:32.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}既是帝王又是绝对的教皇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and pope absolutely in his own kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.55,0:27:35.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么作家？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which writers?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.76,0:27:40.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请允许我给你看本书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have a book to show you, with your permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.84,0:27:46.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给我看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Show it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.73,0:29:40.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}轻柔的爱意 爱的轻盈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Softly love and to love softly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.26,0:29:43.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如枫树枝头的露珠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dew on the sycamore branch.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.71,0:29:48.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的心 飞奔过吱吱作响的大门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By the creaking gate where my heart hurries afterwards
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.24,0:29:51.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}穿过麦田 穿过石南丛中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}through the path of wheat along the briar,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.77,0:29:55.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}直至掩埋我的那片地方…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to that stone.	.	.	 under which I lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.23,0:30:26.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}感谢您的接见 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you for the audience, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.11,0:30:27.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很好 大人们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Very well, my lords.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.01,0:30:29.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.85,0:30:31.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗切福大人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lord rochford?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.63,0:30:34.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 西班牙国王新派的大使 查普大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty, the new imperial ambassador, mr. Chapuys,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.75,0:30:37.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请求您允许他向皇后表达他的敬意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}asks permission to present his credentials to the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.83,0:30:39.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}批准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.83,0:30:41.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人 还有其他事么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My lord, is there anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.75,0:30:45.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 坎佩吉奥主教要回罗马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty, cardinal campeggio is returning to rome
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.51,0:30:48.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想要跟您正式提交辞呈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and would like to take his formal leave of your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.27,0:30:51.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.42,0:30:53.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克伦威尔先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.26,0:30:57.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请他到格莱夫顿宫殿来 叫上沃尔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Invite him here to grafton house. Also wolsey.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.74,0:31:00.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有其他事么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.43,0:31:10.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人 有什么事么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.00,0:31:13.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 请您原谅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty, forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.09,0:31:27.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}马格利特去世了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Margaret is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.68,0:31:33.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}死于肺病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She died of consumption.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.09,0:32:01.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你从未跟我说过她病了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you never even told me she was sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.82,0:32:58.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她是国王的妹妹 怎么国王不来这？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If that's the king's sister, why isn't the king here?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.58,0:33:00.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王不能参加葬礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The king cannot go to funerals.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.31,0:33:00.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.89,0:33:03.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁也不许想象国王驾崩的场景\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No one is allowed to imagine the death of the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.46,0:33:05.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是叛国之罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For that would be treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.17,0:34:08.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你那么关心我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you cared for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.95,0:34:14.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.79,0:34:25.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过来 过来 托马斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come, come, thomas!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.51,0:34:27.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我结果怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell me what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.87,0:34:30.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是不是准时到达康比亚？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I take it you arrived at cambria on time?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.00,0:34:32.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不完全是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.07,0:34:34.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们晚了一周\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We were a week late.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.28,0:34:36.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一周？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A week?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.75,0:34:41.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你们还怎么参与正式的谈判？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then how could you possibly have contributed to the substantive arguments?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.30,0:34:42.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们做不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We couldn'T.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.79,0:34:45.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们无法参与关键问题的讨论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We weren't privy to the main discussions.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.22,0:34:49.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们只被允许参与 几大党派的周边问题讨论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We were only able to enter into peripheral negotiations with the major parties.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.72,0:34:51.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都谈了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What negotiations?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.72,0:34:55.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很高兴向您汇报 我们成功的保住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, I'm happy to report that we secured a return to mutually
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.10,0:34:58.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们与低地国家互利业务关系中的盈利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}beneficial trade relations between ourselves and the low countries.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.44,0:35:02.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们同样获得了罗马皇帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We also obtained guarantees regarding long-standing
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.23,0:35:04.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}长期向国王进贡的保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}payments owing to the king by the emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.32,0:35:06.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那关键的议题呢 托马斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But the major disputes, thomas!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.41,0:35:08.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}关键的议题 结果怎样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The major disputes! What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.42,0:35:11.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法国国王拒绝讲和么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did the king of france refuse to make peace?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.05,0:35:13.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.15,0:35:18.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}相反 他和解了与罗马皇帝之间 的所有分歧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On the contrary he settled all his differences with the emperor
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.39,0:35:24.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且双方也都解决了与教皇之间的分歧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and both of them then settled their differences with his holiness pope clement.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.53,0:35:28.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}换而言之 他们故意将我们孤立\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In other words, we were deliberately sidelined.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.05,0:35:31.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你偏要这么说的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you choose to put it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.51,0:35:51.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么 教皇也就没可能准许 国王的离婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now there is no chance that the pope will give the king his divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.68,0:35:57.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我 托马斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell me, thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.43,0:36:02.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你认为你在康比亚到底 完成了何等功绩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what exactly do you think you might have achieved at cambria,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.95,0:36:06.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让你看起来如此的自鸣得意？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that makes you look so smug?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.52,0:36:10.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}主教大人 恕我非意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With respect your eminence, to some degree
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.76,0:36:14.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我这次去不是为了完成 什么功绩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it wasn't for me to achieve anything
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.80,0:36:18.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我认为这次外交某种意义上是成功的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}yet I consider this diplomacy to be somewhat successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.33,0:36:20.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}欧洲再次和平了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Once more there is peace in europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.37,0:36:24.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}英格兰和罗马帝国和好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}England is at peace with the empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.98,0:36:29.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}更为重要的是 教皇的权威再次树立 并得到了认可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}More importantly, papal authority is restored and recognized.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.23,0:36:31.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这正是我所坚信的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is what I believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.25,0:36:35.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弗朗西斯背叛了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Francis betrayed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.89,0:36:39.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弗朗西斯看到了战争了无用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Francis saw the futility of war.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.85,0:36:42.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他认可遵循传统的必要性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He recognized the need for tradition.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.84,0:36:46.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而你 托马斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you, thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.44,0:36:51.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你毁了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you have destroyed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.24,0:37:11.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Make way!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.47,0:37:35.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阁下 这边请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This way, your excellency.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.41,0:37:57.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}主教大人 这是您的房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your honour's chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.35,0:37:59.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.79,0:38:16.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等等 等等 我的房间呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wait. Wait! Where is my chamber?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.64,0:38:20.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}主教大人 没有为您准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is none prepared for you, your eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.44,0:38:24.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但… 我必须换下我的骑马服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But... I must change from my riding clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.20,0:38:27.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你最好问问别处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then you had best ask elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.32,0:38:44.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.50,0:38:47.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 诺里斯先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah, mr.Norris?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.79,0:38:49.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你可以用我的房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Use my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.01,0:38:54.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}虽然不大 但… 我会把您的行李安置好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's not much, but... I'll have your trunk sent up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.29,0:38:59.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}换好衣服后 你要去会客厅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When you've changed you are to go to the presence chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.63,0:39:02.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}十分感激 诺里斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am grateful to you, norris.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.62,0:39:06.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阁下 这里有很多人都对您心存感激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are many here, sir, who have cause to be grateful to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.39,0:39:09.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管他们有时候并不表现出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Though alas, they do not show it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.11,0:39:28.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红衣主教沃尔西和坎佩吉奥参见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}cardinals wolsey and campeggio.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.60,0:40:03.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听说您身体欠佳 是真的么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hear you've been unwell. Is it true?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.64,0:40:09.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 我何时因身体欠佳 而未能向您效忠？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty, when was I ever unwell enough not to serve you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.40,0:40:12.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这正是我所想的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's what I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.14,0:40:14.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些人 他们说谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They tell such lies, these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.71,0:40:22.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我能相信谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who can I trust?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.10,0:40:28.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}主教大人 你和我 我们经历风雨一路走来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We've come a long way together, you and I, cardinal.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.61,0:40:31.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你认为我会忘记吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you think I'd forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.11,0:40:34.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}需要做的还有很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And there is still a great deal more to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.81,0:40:36.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我明白 我明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.31,0:40:43.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.32,0:40:47.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们明天可以好好谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We shall talk properly tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.07,0:41:33.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早上好 甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}good morning sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.86,0:41:40.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}躲开 我有话要对国王讲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stand aside. I must speak with the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.52,0:41:43.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stand aside!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.10,0:41:46.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.92,0:41:49.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.62,0:41:51.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.35,0:42:00.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 陛下 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty! Majesty! Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.65,0:42:04.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}查普大使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ambassador chapuys.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.55,0:42:06.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.85,0:42:14.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗马皇帝派我来向您呈上委任书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have come at the king's invitation to present my credentials from the emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.48,0:42:17.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这边请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.66,0:42:25.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很高兴见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am glad to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.01,0:42:29.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要知道 在这乱世下你接受这个任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know your mission has fallen at a complicated time.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.30,0:42:30.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}千真万确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.75,0:42:34.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}皇后 我从未视自己的任务为难事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I see my mission, madam, as one oftoute douceur.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.61,0:42:37.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说的好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All sweetness!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.32,0:42:41.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请问殿下 我是否该同时将委任状\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I ask your highness if I should now, at once,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.35,0:42:46.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呈交给红衣主教沃尔西？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}also present my credentials to his eminence cardinal wolsey?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.85,0:42:50.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跟以前相比 我看现在没有这个必要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do not see that there is such a need as before.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.71,0:42:54.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}主教某种程度上已经… 失宠了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The cardinal is somewhat... undone.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.89,0:42:57.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他已经被进入跨入宫廷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has been refused permission to attend court.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.30,0:43:04.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那我应该去拜访谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then who should I attend instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.14,0:43:08.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诺福克 萨福克和罗切福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Norfolk, suffolk and rochford.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.44,0:43:11.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们现在是国王的近臣 掌管日常事务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}they are now closest to the king, and carry out his affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.95,0:43:14.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你想了解内情 就去拜访他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seek them out if you would know things.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.41,0:43:20.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但你同样要知道 大使大人 他们并不是我的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Me but you should also know ambassador, that they are no great friends of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.04,0:43:23.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}任何一个都不是 应该说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Any of them. In fact better to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.62,0:43:26.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们都是我的死敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}they are all my mortal enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.53,0:43:33.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Make way!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.06,0:43:49.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}沃尔西主教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cardinal wolsey!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.93,0:43:54.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你被控蔑视王权罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are here charged with praemunire:
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.15,0:43:58.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在国王的领土擅用罗马主教的权力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is exercising your powers of papal legate in the king's realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.46,0:44:00.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因而诋毁了国王的权威\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}thus derogating the king's lawful authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.02,0:44:03.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你被免除一切职务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are to be dismissed of all your offices
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.50,0:44:05.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的财物将交与国王手中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and all your goods shall be taken into the king's hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.46,0:44:11.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们是否有国王亲手起草的文书？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I take it you have the king's written authority for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.09,0:44:26.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你被命交出你的文印\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are commanded to relinquish the great seal of your office.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.20,0:44:31.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要去哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And where am I to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.58,0:44:34.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你将被驱逐至国王杰瑞克的宅子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To the king's house at jericho.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.45,0:44:37.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等待审判的裁决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To await the verdict of the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.08,0:44:54.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快给尊敬的大人让路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Make way for his lord's grace there!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.62,0:45:04.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在给我们祈祷一下 如何 大人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How 'bout a blessing now, your eminence?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.97,0:45:13.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我永远眷爱的克伦威尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My own eternally beloved cromwell,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.43,0:45:19.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我恳求你 如果你深深敬爱着我 就应为我做任何事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I beseech you, as you love me and will ever do anything for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.70,0:45:22.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你今天的工作一完成 就马上来看我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}come here today, as soon as your work is finished,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.42,0:45:25.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要理其他事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and forgetting everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.25,0:45:27.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不单是为了我的释然 而求见于你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For I would not only communicate things to you
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.49,0:45:32.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}同样也能给予你由衷并悲痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for my own comfort and relief, but would also have your good,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.38,0:45:36.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并缜密的忠告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}sad, discreet advice and counsel.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.35,0:45:39.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}星期六 用我颤抖的双手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In haste, this saturday,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.27,0:45:45.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和悲切的心草写此书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with the rude hand and sorrowful heart of your assured who loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.16,0:45:47.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}沃尔西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wolsey.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.89,0:46:08.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}沃尔西承认了对他所有的指控\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wolsey pleaded guilty to all the charges made against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.34,0:46:10.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 我听说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.82,0:46:12.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他被判决入狱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And sentenced to prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.10,0:46:14.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我废除了对他的处罚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have rescinded his punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.27,0:46:17.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我甚至同意保留他的约克主教的头衔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've even agreed to let him keep the bishopric of york,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.72,0:46:20.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还支付他3000安格尔的养老金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with a pension of 3000 angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.19,0:46:24.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你看我这算是个什么"魔鬼"？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You see what kind of monster I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.64,0:46:30.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我需要委任一个新的议政大臣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I need to appoint a new chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.09,0:46:32.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个我能信任的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Someone I can trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.54,0:46:36.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你学过法律和皇室礼仪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're trained as a lawyer and in royal service.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.27,0:46:39.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你也有国际威望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have international prestige.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.01,0:46:44.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是伊拉兹马斯的朋友 全英格兰至高的人道主义者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The friend of erasmus, the greatest humanist in all england.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.38,0:46:47.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你有敏锐细腻的头脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have a fine, sharp mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.51,0:46:48.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.68,0:46:49.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No what!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.47,0:46:51.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 我不想成为议政大臣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, I don't want to be chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.26,0:46:52.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你必须按照我的命令去做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will do as I command!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.51,0:47:04.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听着 托马斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Listen thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.60,0:47:07.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道你在我的离婚问题上颇有顾虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know you have scruples concerning my divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.30,0:47:08.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我向你保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I swear to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.89,0:47:12.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这件事只会交给在良心上能接受此事 的人来处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it will only be dealt with by those whose consciences agree with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.00,0:47:15.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只要你处理其他的事项\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll only use you for other things
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.25,0:47:18.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我绝不让此事困扰你的良心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I will never let it molest your conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.77,0:47:24.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听着… 汤姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}look... tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.52,0:47:32.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我希望 并且命令你 你将来的所作所为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want you, nay I command you, in all the things that you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.25,0:47:38.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要看在上帝的份上 也要看在我的份上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to look to god first, and only then to me.
